          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145609,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Giochi come quello qui sotto devono spesso eseguire più e più volte la stessa attività.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 275px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #0B1020;&#xA;    color: #E6F0FF;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: #2D6BFF;&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;    cursor: pointer;&#xA;   }&#xA;   #container {&#xA;    margin-top: 10px;&#xA;    min-height: 20px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img height=180 src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/heart.png&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;heal()&quot;&gt;Use health potion&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;    let health = 50;&#xA;    function heal() {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;container&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Healed! Health is now &quot; + (health += 10);&#xA;     let s = document.getElementById(&quot;container&quot;).style;&#xA;     s.display = &quot;block&quot;;&#xA;     s.opacity = 1;&#xA;     (function fade() {&#xA;      if ((s.opacity -= .1) &lt; 0) s.display = &quot;none&quot;;&#xA;      else setTimeout(fade, 150);&#xA;     })();&#xA;    }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145610,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invece di creare molto codice diverso, i giochi usano le <strong>funzioni</strong> per raggruppare il codice correlato ed eseguire l'attività in un unico posto.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 275px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #0B1020;&#xA;    color: #E6F0FF;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   button {&#xA;    background-color: #FF3B6B;&#xA;    border: none;&#xA;    border-radius: 8px;&#xA;    color: white;&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    text-decoration: none;&#xA;    display: inline-block;&#xA;    font-size: 14px;&#xA;    padding: 6px 12px;&#xA;    margin: 0 12px 0 0;&#xA;    cursor: pointer;&#xA;   }&#xA;   #container {&#xA;    margin-top: 10px;&#xA;    min-height: 20px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img height=180 src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/heart.png&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;  &lt;button onclick=&quot;takeDamage()&quot;&gt;Enemy hit&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;    let health = 50;&#xA;    function takeDamage() {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;container&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Ouch! Health is now &quot; + (health -= 10);&#xA;     let s = document.getElementById(&quot;container&quot;).style;&#xA;     s.display = &quot;block&quot;;&#xA;     s.opacity = 1;&#xA;     (function fade() {&#xA;      if ((s.opacity -= .1) &lt; 0) s.display = &quot;none&quot;;&#xA;      else setTimeout(fade, 150);&#xA;     })();&#xA;    }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145611,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per iniziare a raggruppare il codice correlato, cominciamo scrivendo la parola chiave <code>function</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"8\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" }\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>function</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145612,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Segue il nome della funzione in camel case, come <code>spawnEnemy</code>, seguito dalle parentesi, <code>(</code> e <code>)</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>spawnEnemy</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145613,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le parentesi graffe <code>{</code> e <code>}</code> delimitano il blocco di codice che appartiene alla funzione.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145614,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il codice che vogliamo raggruppare va inserito tra le parentesi graffe. Questa funzione raggruppa due istruzioni <code>console.log()</code> correlate.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"88\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Get ready to fight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>console</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>log</code>, <code>\"Get ready to fight\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145615,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per eseguire il codice, dobbiamo <strong>chiamare</strong> la funzione. Lo facciamo scrivendo il suo nome seguito dalle parentesi, come <code>spawnEnemy();</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"107\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy spawned&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Get ready to fight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"spawnEnemy();}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>spawnEnemy();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145616,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come iniziamo a raggruppare il codice correlato?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Aggiungendo la parola chiave <code>function</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aggiungendo parentesi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Aggiungendo la parola chiave <code>function</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
